Fixed TypeScript parsing of TypeScript 5.0 type-only star re-exports (`export type * from "…"` and `export type * as ns from "…"`) in the `typescript` and `tsx` grammars. These constructs previously produced a syntax error at the `type` token and silently abandoned the rest of the file (reported as a `PartialParsing` warning), so everything after the offending line was never analysed.
